WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.900
Just Speak to It is now on Linux, in beta. Everything here is sample data.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:09.933
A native GTK app, with the same dashboard.

00:00:09.933 --> 00:00:14.200
Start dictating from any app with a global shortcut.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.433
A small overlay shows the words as you speak.

00:00:17.433 --> 00:00:21.533
Stop, and the text is pasted into the original window.

00:00:21.533 --> 00:00:27.133
Settings cover your microphone, how text is inserted, and more.

00:00:27.133 --> 00:00:31.267
Download the Linux beta at justspeaktoit.com.
